<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dīlātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		differo, B. 3., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a putting off, delaying, deferring</i> (good
			prose). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">temporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Phil. 3, 1, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">comitiorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. de Imp. Pomp. 1, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">belli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 9,
					43</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">45</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foederis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 9,
				5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exitii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					6, 4 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			 al.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alter (consul) nullam dilationem patiebatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					21, 52</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">40, 57</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sen. de Ira, 3, 12: solatium dilationis et
					morae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Ner. 15</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Act. 25, 17 al.</span></i>; in
			plur., <i><span class="en">Liv. 5, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vell. 2,
			79</span></i>, al.—Esp. law t. t., <i>the
				adjournment</i> of a legal hearing or judgment: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cassius, interpellatis judicibus, dilationem
					petiit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet.
					Gram. 22</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The interval</i>: spatiosa, Apul. M. 11, p. 262,
			28.</div>
